  "run": {
    "final_text": "I added the v2.4.0 notes to the top of `RELEASE_NOTES.md`. The version and date come from the `VERSION` and `RELEASE_DATE` files, and the wording follows the style of the earlier entries:\n\n```\nv2.4.0 - 2026-10-20\n  * CSV exporter for the report command (ACME-412)\n  * Retry uploads on 503 errors with backoff (ACME-415)\n  * Fix crash when the config file is empty (ACME-419)\n  * Fix wrong totals in the monthly summary for leap years (ACME-423)\n```\n\n- **ACME-421 is left out.** It was the only change marked as breaking (`!`, removing `--legacy` from sync). Since it was reverted, `--legacy` still works and this release has no breaking changes or upgrade warnings.\n- **No author credits.** The earlier entries don't name authors, so I didn't either. I can add @mira, @jonas, @tom and @priya if you want them.",
